# Required for the contact form to actually send emails, straight to your Gmail inbox.
#
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on the Google account you want to send from:
#    https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (choose "Mail" as the app — Google gives you a 16-character password)
# 3. Fill in both values below. GMAIL_USER is the Gmail address you generated
#    the App Password for (it sends the mail); messages land in site.email
#    (src/data/site.ts), with the visitor's address set as Reply-To.
GMAIL_USER=
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
